msgctxt "quest 1"
msgid "Bones by the Gate"
msgstr ""

#. What a quest's giver says, giving it.
#: content/quests.txtpb
msgctxt "quest 1"
msgid "Skeletons climb out of the ground around the gate, and they don't stay down for long. Put three of them back, and I'll see you're paid for it."
msgstr ""

#. A quest's name.
#: content/quests.txtpb
